        <p>THE ORIGINAL AND ONLY GENUINE. CHLORODYNE is admitted by the Profession to be the most wonderfn4and valuable remedy ever dim eovered. pHLORODYNE is the best remedy known for 14.../ Coughs, Consumption, Bronchitis and Asthma. CIILORODYNE effectually checks and arrests those too often fatal diseases—Diphtheria, Fever, Croup, Ague. CiILORODYNE acts like a charm in Diarrhcea and is the only specific in Cholera and Dysentery. CIILORODYNIi effectually cuts short all attacks of Epilepsy, Hysteria. Palpitation, and Spasms. CHLORODYNE IS the only palliative in Neural- eta, Rheumatism, Gout, Cancer, Toothache, Meningitis, ac. _</p>
