      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-01-18_WidnesExaminer_art0064" n="art0064">
        <head>TUE POPULAR JEWELLER.</head>
        <p>TUE POPULAR JEWELLER.</p>
        <p>42, 11ORSRMA1KET-STREET, WARRINGTON. xs NOW SHOWING all the latest and newest designs in GOLD AND SILVER JEWELLERY, PLATE, ETC„ for the present season. Our prices are undoubtedly lower than any other establishment in town, A visit will prove it.</p>
