        <p>DEATHS. LEICESTER—January 3rd. at Lythgoes-Lane. Warrington Henry Thomas Leicester, aged 63 years. Woos—January 4th, at Haydock-street, Warrington, Walter Wood. aged 11 years. WALKDEN—January 6th. at Turner-street. Warrington, Catherine Walkden, aged 42 years. BRAMHALL—January 7th, at Kautsford-road. Warrington, Catherine Bramhall, aged 69 years. HamEETr —January Bth, at Orford-lane, Warrington. Ishmael Hayho Hackett, aged 55 years. IN MEMORIAM. In ever lc ving memory of my Dear Mother. Hannah Owen, who fell asleep January 17th, 1897, aged 70 years. Gone but never forgotten.</p>
